      "Trigger, Understanding Early Civilizations",
      "Eisenstadt, The Civilizational Dimension",
      "Hodgson, The Venture of Islam (islamicate)",
      "Pollock, The Language of the Gods (Sanskrit cosmopolis)",
      "Wolters, History, Culture, and Region in Southeast Asian Perspectives (mandala)",
